This example is a placeholder.  Use the `v2_bench` test instead:

cargo test --release -p deep_ali \
--features "parallel sha3-N mldsa-N" --no-default-features \
v2_bench -- --ignored --nocapture

where (sha3-N, mldsa-N) ∈ {(sha3-256, mldsa-44), (sha3-384, mldsa-65), (sha3-512, mldsa-87)}
for NIST PQ Levels 1, 3, 5 respectively.

Or use the wrapper scripts in scripts/aws-bench/.
